    "summary": "PLOS Medicine publishes clinical and public-health research with an author-summary panel alongside the abstract.\n\nDistilled requirements: No body word limit; abstract up to 300 words; required sections: Introduction, Methods, Results, Discussion; Vancouver citation style.\n\nAlso required: Structured abstract (Background/Methods and Findings/Conclusions); Author Summary (non-technical) required; Data availability statement required.\n\nThis summary is the app's distillation \u2014 open the author instructions above to confirm against the journal's current text.",
